WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:07.619
Maya's notebook has every recipe, and she cannot carry it up without losing pages!

3
00:00:08.419 --> 00:00:11.685
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:12.485 --> 00:00:14.997
This is Episode 74.

5
00:00:15.797 --> 00:00:17.649
Meet the pour-pitcher.

6
00:00:18.449 --> 00:00:23.024
It dips its spout into the old notebook and pours the pages up, one by one.

7
00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:26.442
And Maya keeps writing the whole time.

8
00:00:27.242 --> 00:00:29.542
The new drawing flows up too.

9
00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:34.823
Up on the cloud, the pages land in a new notebook, in the same order.

10
00:00:35.623 --> 00:00:37.698
Not one page lost.

11
00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:40.550
Not one minute closed.

12
00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.595
That is AWS Database Migration Service, DMS.

13
00:00:46.395 --> 00:00:50.428
It copies a database to the cloud while the old one keeps working.

14
00:00:51.228 --> 00:00:53.316
Now you know the pour-pitcher!

15
00:00:54.116 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

